        <h2>About</h2>
        <p>When I'm not busy solving problems, you'll find me supporting fellow artists through my work with <a href="https://www.openartfolke.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open Art Folke</a>.</p>
        <p>Before doing what I now do, I spent six years between cultural institutions and the Film &amp; TV industry. Broadly often doing the job of making complex realities a little less complex while drawing audiences closer to worthwhile ideas, services and creative talent. </p>
        <p>
        I graduated in Digital Arts from the University of Greenwich, which is where much of this all began.
        I'm now based in Folkestone, on the Kent coast, but I was born in Lazio, Italy, in a land called Ciociaria.</p>
    </section>
